    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "kanazawa-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第1問　解答・解説",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "1 ②／2 ⓪／3 ④／4 ③／5 ⑥／6 ⑤／7 ①／8 ⑧／9 ⑨／10 ③／11 ⑤／12 ③／13 ⓪"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "14 ③／15 ①／16 ⑥／17 ③／18 ①／19 ⑥"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "20 ⑦／21 ⓪／22 ③／23 ⓪／24 ②／25 ①／26 ③／27 ①"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の全体像",
            "text": "光の振動数の変動幅から天体の速さを決め、周期から角速度、円運動から半径、万有引力から質量へ進む。観測者が動く場合も、まず変動幅と観測周期を分けて考える。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "準備　光のドップラー効果と変動幅",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "与えられた近似式(A)を、観測振動数の形へ直す。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'=f-\\frac{v}{c}f=\\frac{c-v}{c}f",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "光源が速さ \\(V\\) で近づくときと速さ \\(V'\\) で遠ざかるときの差を取る。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}f_1'&=\\frac{c+V}{c}f\\\\f_2'&=\\frac{c-V'}{c}f\\\\\\Delta f'&=\\frac{V+V'}{c}f\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 角速度・速さ・半径・質量",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "変動周期は天体Pの公転周期なので、最初に角速度を求める。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\omega_1=\\frac{2\\pi}{3.14\\times10^4}=2.0\\times10^{-4}\\,\\mathrm{rad/s}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "近づく速さと遠ざかる速さはどちらも \\(V_1\\) なので、変動幅は \\(2V_1f/c\\)。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{2V_1}{c}=2.4\\times10^{-3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_1=1.2\\times10^{-3}\\times3.00\\times10^8=3.6\\times10^5\\,\\mathrm{m/s}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kanazawa-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "円運動の関係 \\(V_1=r_1\\omega_1\\) から軌道半径を求める。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r_1=\\frac{V_1}{\\omega_1}=1.8\\times10^9\\,\\mathrm{m}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "万有引力を向心力として運動方程式を立てる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "G\\frac{M_1m}{r_1^2}=m\\frac{V_1^2}{r_1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}M_1&=\\frac{V_1^2r_1}{G}\\\\&=3.49\\times10^{30}\\fallingdotseq3.5\\times10^{30}\\,\\mathrm{kg}\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) 観測者が遠ざかる場合",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "近づく速さは \\(V-v_0\\)、遠ざかる速さは \\(V+v_0\\)。二つを足すと \\(v_0\\) が消えるため、変動幅から得る速さは \\(V_2=V_1\\) のままである。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\Delta f'=\\frac{V-v_0+V+v_0}{c}f=\\frac{2V}{c}f",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "次に観測周期を扱う。実周期 \\(T_2\\) の間に観測者が \\(v_0T_2\\) 遠ざかるため、その距離を光が進む時間だけ観測周期が伸びる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "T_1=T_2+\\frac{v_0T_2}{c}\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad T_2=\\frac{c}{c+v_0}T_1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\omega_2=\\frac{c+v_0}{c}\\omega_1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r_2=\\frac{V_2}{\\omega_2}=\\left(1+\\frac{v_0}{c}\\right)^{-1}r_1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "M_2=\\frac{V_1^2r_2}{G}=\\left(1+\\frac{v_0}{c}\\right)^{-1}M_1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 二つの天体の質量",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "振動数の変動幅は天体の速さに比例する。二つの変動幅を(1)と比べて速さを表す。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_3=\\frac32V_1,\\qquad V_4=\\frac12V_1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kanazawa-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "周期が同じなので角速度も同じ。したがって速さと回転半径は比例する。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}r_3&=\\frac32r_1,\\qquad r_4=\\frac12r_1\\\\r_3+r_4&=2r_1\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "天体Q′と天体P′の運動方程式を順に立てる。向心力を与えるのは互いの万有引力で、天体間距離は \\(2r_1\\) である。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "G\\frac{m'M'}{(2r_1)^2}=M'\\frac{(V_1/2)^2}{r_1/2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "m'=2\\frac{V_1^2r_1}{G}=2M_1\\fallingdotseq7.0\\times10^{30}\\,\\mathrm{kg}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "G\\frac{m'M'}{(2r_1)^2}=m'\\frac{(3V_1/2)^2}{3r_1/2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "M'=6M_1\\fallingdotseq2.1\\times10^{31}\\,\\mathrm{kg}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　解答・解説",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "28 ⊕／29 ④／30 ②／31 ⊖／32 ④／33 ⑦／34 ①"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "35 ⊕／36 ①／37 ⑧／38 ⊖／39 ②／40 ⓪／41 ①"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "42 ①／43 ⑤／44 ①／45 ⑤／46 ⊖／47 ①／48 ⑦／49 ①"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の全体像",
            "text": "床から水平方向の外力が働かないので、小球と台を合わせた水平運動量は保存する。摩擦がないので力学的エネルギーも保存し、変位では重心の水平位置が変わらないことを使う。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 点Bでの小球と台の速度",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最初に水平運動量保存を立て、次に小球が失った位置エネルギーを小球と台の運動エネルギーの和へ変える。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1.0v_B+9.0V_B=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac12\\times1.0v_B^2+\\frac12\\times9.0V_B^2=1.0\\times9.8\\times1.0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "小球は右向き、台は左向きなので \\(v_B>0,V_B<0\\) を選ぶ。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}V_B&\\fallingdotseq-4.7\\times10^{-1}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}\\\\v_B&=+4.2\\,\\mathrm{m/s}\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "kanazawa-medical-2025-general-early-physics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) 点Dまでの小球と台の変位",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "水平運動量の和は常に0なので、系の重心の水平位置は変わらない。小球の変位を \\(l\\)、台の変位を \\(L\\) とすると次の式になる。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "l+9.0L=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "小球は台に対して左端から右端へ \\(2.0\\,\\mathrm{m}\\) 移動する。床から見て小球は右、台は左なので \\(l-L=2.0\\)。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "l-L=2.0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{aligned}l&=+1.8\\,\\mathrm{m}\\\\L&=-2.0\\times10^{-1}\\,\\mathrm{m}\\end{aligned}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 点Dから飛び出すときの速度",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "点Aから点Dまでに小球が失った位置エネルギーを、小球と台の運動エネルギーへ変える。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "v_x^2+v_y^2+9.0V_D^2=4.9\\qquad\\cdots\\text{①}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "水平方向の運動量保存から、小球と台の水平速度を結ぶ。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "v_x=-9.0V_D\\qquad\\cdots\\text{②}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "射出角42°は台から見た角度である。したがって水平の相対速度は \\(v_x-V_D\\) を使う。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{v_y}{v_x-V_D}=0.90\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad v_y=-9.0V_D\\qquad\\cdots\\text{③}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "②、③を①へ代入し、台が左向きで \\(V_D<0\\) であることから符号を決める。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_D\\fallingdotseq-1.7\\times10^{-1}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "v_x=1.5\\,\\mathrm{m/s},\\qquad v_y=1.5\\,\\mathrm{m/s}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
